    direction TB

    state "RECEIVED - logged at the date it reached the employer" as RECEIVED
    state "ROUTED - case type and clocks set from that date's threshold facts" as ROUTED
    state "EVIDENCE_ASSEMBLED - reconstruction packs and related records pulled" as EVIDENCE
    state "ACTION_INITIATED - the employer initiates action under the Act" as ACTION
    state "RESPONSE_DRAFTED - assembled parts 1, 2, 3 and 5, part 4 authored by the employer" as DRAFTED
    state "RESPONSE_ISSUED - approved by a named person, channel and date recorded" as ISSUED
    state "ESCALATED_EXTERNAL - notice of proceedings before a Commissioner, Ombudsman, Local Committee or court" as ESCALATED
    state "CLOSED - outcome and closing note recorded" as CLOSED
    state "REOPENED - further complaint or direction on the same facts" as REOPENED

    [*] --> RECEIVED: K1 intake, retention hold placed on the subject's snapshots
    RECEIVED --> ROUTED: K2 routing on threshold facts with their counting units
    ROUTED --> EVIDENCE: K3 owner requests the pack
    EVIDENCE --> ACTION: K4 exit a, initiate action under the Act
    EVIDENCE --> DRAFTED: K5 exit b, written reasoned response, RPwD Rule 3 clause 2 cases only
    DRAFTED --> ISSUED: K6 named approver issues, never sent automatically
    ROUTED --> ESCALATED: K7 external proceedings, hold widened
    EVIDENCE --> ESCALATED: K7
    ISSUED --> CLOSED: K8 outcome recorded, clocks stopped, hold not released
    ACTION --> CLOSED: K8
    ESCALATED --> CLOSED: K8
    CLOSED --> REOPENED: K9 new clock instance, prior record untouched
    REOPENED --> EVIDENCE: Owner reworks the case
    CLOSED --> [*]

